<title>USA: USDA - Jordan gets $21 mln under PL480 for wheat.</title>
<headline>USDA - Jordan gets $21 mln under PL480 for wheat.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said an authorization to purchase $21 million worth of U.S. wheat under Public Law 480 was issued to Jordan.</p>
<p>USDA said the contracting period is March 19 through September 30 and the delivery period is March 19 through December 31.</p>
</text>
